<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <title>Fingerprint tutorial - watch before you start</title>
  </head>
  <body style="margin:0;padding:0;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-color:#f0f2f5;">
    <table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="max-width:600px;margin:20px auto">
      
      <!-- Header with Logos -->
      <tr>
        <td bgcolor="#ffffff" align="center" style="padding:20px 0">
          <img src="https://snedai-dev.seamfix.com.ng/assets/icons/mfa-trio-logo.png" alt="Ministry Logos" style="max-width:90%;height:auto" />
        </td>
      </tr>

      <!-- Main Content -->
      <tr>
        <td bgcolor="#ffffff" style="padding:30px 40px;">
          <table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
            <tr>
              <td style="color:#333;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;">

                <p style="margin:0 0 15px 0;">Hello<% if (firstName) { %> <%= firstName %><% } %>,</p>

                <p style="margin:0 0 15px 0;">You're so close! Just fingerprints and signature, left.</p>

                <p style="margin:0 0 15px 0;">Fingerprint capture is the most technical step, but our tutorial makes it easy.</p>

                <p style="margin:0 0 15px 0;">WATCH THIS 2-MINUTE TUTORIAL: 
                  <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_E5WCguzoT8" target="_blank" style="color:#0c3b63;text-decoration: underline;;"><strong>Video Tutorial Link</strong></a>
                </p>

                <p style="margin:0 0 15px 0;">The tutorial shows you exactly how to position your fingers to get the best results. </p>

                <p style="margin:0 0 10px 0;">Common mistakes:</p>

                <ul style="margin:0 0 20px 20px;padding:0;">
                  <li>Fingers not clean or camera blurry. So, start by washing your hands and wiping your phone camera!</li>
                </ul>

                <p style="margin:0 0 15px 0;">This step takes 3 minutes if you follow the tutorial. After this + signature, your payment processes and you're basically done! </p>

                <p style="margin:0 0 15px 0;"><strong>Lets go!</strong></p>

                <!-- CTA -->
                <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:0 0 20px 0">
                  <tr>
                    <td align="center" bgcolor="#0c3b63" style="border-radius:4px;padding:14px 30px">
                      <a href="<%= appDeepLink || '#' %>" style="color:#ffffff;font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block">WATCH TUTORIAL AND START</a>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>

                <% if (supportEmail) { %>
                  <p style="font-size:13px;color:#555;margin:20px 0 5px 0;">Need help? Contact: 
                    <a href="mailto:<%= supportEmail %>" style="color:#0c3b63;text-decoration:none"><%= supportEmail %></a>
                  </p>
                <% } %>

              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>
        </td>
      </tr>

      <!-- Footer (unchanged) -->
      <tr>
        <td bgcolor="#0a2d52" style="padding:30px 40px;color:#ffffff">
          <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="color:#ffffff;font-size:13px">
            
            <tr>
              <td>
                <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%">
                  <tr>
                    <td width="50%" valign="middle">
                      <img src="https://snedai-dev.seamfix.com.ng/assets/icons/mfa_logo.png" alt="MFA Logo" style="height:45px" />
                    </td>
                    <td width="50%" align="right" valign="middle">
                      <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/benin-diplomatie/">
                        <img style="height:24px;margin:0 5px" src="https://snedai-dev.seamfix.com.ng/assets/icon/linkedIn_icon.png" alt="LinkedIn" />
                      </a>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
              <td style="padding-top:20px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5">
                © Ministry of Foreign Affairs – <%= new Date().getFullYear().toString() %><br />
                2 Plateaux Vallons, Abidjan, Côte d'Ivoire
              </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
              <td style="padding-top:20px;font-size:16px;font-weight:bold">Get the ePass app</td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
              <td style="padding-top:10px">
                <a href="https://apps.apple.com/app/govsmart">
                  <img style="height:40px;margin-right:10px" src="https://snedai-dev.seamfix.com.ng/assets/icon/apple-store.png" alt="App Store" />
                </a>
                <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.govsmart">
                  <img style="height:40px" src="https://snedai-dev.seamfix.com.ng/assets/icon/google-play.png" alt="Google Play" />
                </a>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
              <td style="padding-top:30px;padding-bottom:20px">
                <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%">
                  <tr>
                    <td width="33.33%" height="5px" bgcolor="#F77F00"></td>
                    <td width="33.33%" height="5px" bgcolor="#FFFFFF"></td>
                    <td width="33.33%" height="5px" bgcolor="#009A44"></td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
              <td align="center">
                <span style="font-size:12px;vertical-align:middle">Powered by</span>
                <img src="https://snedai-dev.seamfix.com.ng/assets/icons/seamfix.svg" style="margin-left:8px;height:20px;vertical-align:middle" alt="Seamfix Logo" />
              </td>
            </tr>

          </table>
        </td>
      </tr>

    </table>
  </body>
</html>
